    "innovation": "This paper uses data-driven and land-surface models to reconstruct global water availability from 1902-2014, attributing the observed pattern of drier dry seasons in many regions to human-induced climate change, which is primarily driven by increasing evapotranspiration rather than decreasing precipitation.",
